@startuml sequence_diagram_update_status
title Изменение статуса заказа

actor Operator
participant "MES Frontend" as UI
participant "MES API" as API
participant "Redis (кеш)" as Redis
participant "MES DB" as DB

Operator -> UI: Изменить статус заказа
UI -> API: PATCH /api/orders/{id} (новый статус)
API -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status = ? WHERE id = ?
DB --> API: success
API -> Redis: DEL orders:list
API -> Redis: DEL order:{id}
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> Operator: Подтверждение обновления
@enduml